- Do the parties need a scheduling order or more time for discovery? (Attorney will propose timeline.)
- Is any emergency relief requested (TRO, preliminary injunction)? (If you want, discuss with Amy whether to request.)
Preparation: work with Amy to prepare concise responses; let her do the legal argument.

Common questions opposing counsel might ask (and how to prepare)
- Do you admit or deny the core allegations? (Work with Amy to decide what to admit/deny; don’t volunteer extra detail.)
