- Who else saw or has access to the allegedly confidential information? (Make a list of recipients and devices and give to Amy.)
- What damages or losses has the plaintiff suffered? (They may try to pin liability and damages on you; consult Amy before responding.)
- Are you willing to discuss settlement/mediation? (Decide strategy with Amy before negotiating.)
Preparation tip: coordinate all substantive responses through Amy; do not negotiate or make admissions directly to opposing counsel without consulting her.

