- Copy of the NDA (all versions), signature pages, amendments
- Complaint and all court documents served on you (summons, exhibits)
- Proof of service documents
- Timeline of events (chronology with dates, short descriptions)
- All communications relevant to the NDA: emails, texts, DMs, letters (including metadata if possible)
