- Have the parties been properly served? (Who was served and when?)
- Are there any jurisdictional or venue issues?
- What is the status of pleadings (answer filed, motions pending)?
- Do the parties request more time to answer or to complete discovery?
- Is the case ready to proceed to trial, or is a settlement/mediation likely?
- Estimated length of trial and date availability.
- Are there any outstanding discovery disputes or requested protective orders?
- Any requests for consolidation, bifurcation, or scheduling of dispositive motions?

