- Requests for documents and communications (emails, drafts, internal notes)
- Questions aimed at establishing breach and damages (what was disclosed, who received it, what loss resulted)
- Questions about defenses (timing, waiver, scope of NDA, authorization)
- Attempts to pin down your version of events through interrogatories and deposition questions
- Attempts to discover financial condition if damages or collection is an issue

