A. Practical questions to ask your lawyer (Amy Foster — prioritize these at the top of the meeting)
1. Timeline & deadlines
   - What exact deadlines apply now (deadline to respond to the complaint, deadlines for the preliminary hearing, discovery cutoffs, motion deadlines)?
