- Draft a concise list of these questions formatted to send to Amy via email? OR
- Role-play likely judge and opposing counsel questions so you can practice answers? OR
- Help you build the timeline/evidence checklist (I can format a list you can fill in)?

If you want tailored sample answers for the likely questions, share a bit more factual detail (e.g., key dates, what the NDA covers, whether you signed and when, the core allegation) and I’ll draft practice responses you can review with Amy.

