- Settlement posture: are we expected to try to settle pre-hearing/mediation? What is a reasonable settlement range? What are the pros and cons of settlement vs. litigation here?

C. Questions the judge might ask at the preliminary hearing / case conference
- Is the defendant represented or will counsel enter an appearance?
- Have the parties met and conferred regarding discovery and scheduling?
