- Bring photo ID, copies of key exhibits (organized and tabbed), the original NDA, and a notebook.
- Confirm courtroom number, arrival time (arrive early), dress conservatively, and silence electronics.
- If confidential materials are used, ask Amy about requesting the court seal or protective order in advance.
- Discuss with Amy whether you should testify at preliminary hearings or only if called at trial.

Preservation and communications
- Preserve all devices, backups, and accounts that may contain relevant info—do not delete anything.
- Turn off auto-deletes and hold routine data purges.
- Put a litigation hold on emails or records related to the dispute.
- Don’t communicate with the plaintiff/creditor directly; refer them to Amy.

