Immediate priorities
- Note the deadline to respond to the service (Answer, motion to dismiss, or other response). Ask Amy whether you need an emergency filing or extension.
- Preserve all relevant evidence now (see checklist below). Do not delete messages, documents, or social posts.
- Avoid discussing the case with anyone except your attorney; do not post about it on social media.
